1
00:00:00,105 --> 00:00:01,775
(Raj:)Good morning, everybody.

2
00:00:01,941 --> 00:00:03,921
(Raj:)I picked up coffee
while I was out.

3
00:00:04,076 --> 00:00:06,526
(Scene:)Bernadette,
here's your soy peppermint mocha.

4
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:08,679
(Bernadette:)You didn't have to do that.

5
00:00:08,847 --> 00:00:09,787
(Raj:)Oh, my pleasure, and don't worry

6
00:00:09,949 --> 00:00:10,929
(Raj:)about your presentation today.

7
00:00:11,083 --> 00:00:12,123
You're going to be great.

8
00:00:12,284 --> 00:00:14,284
Yeah, you're going to
knock it out of the park.

9
00:00:14,453 --> 00:00:16,433
(Bernadette:)What presentation do I have today?

10
00:00:18,123 --> 00:00:19,393
(Sheldon:)Just go.

11
00:00:23,462 --> 00:00:24,802
(Raj:)He loves you.

12
00:00:25,264 --> 00:00:26,264
(Howard:)What are you doing?

13
00:00:26,365 --> 00:00:27,535
(Howard:)Are you trying
to make me look bad?

14
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,080
(Raj:)I'm just being
a good house guest.

15
00:00:29,235 --> 00:00:30,545
(Howard:)No, you're being
a better husband than I am.

16
00:00:30,703 --> 00:00:32,273
(Howard:)Doing the dishes,
getting coffee,

17
00:00:32,438 --> 00:00:33,478
knowing about her life?

18
00:00:33,639 --> 00:00:34,909
(Howard:)Who does that?

19
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:38,045
(Raj:)Oh, come on,
I brought you one, too.

20
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:39,710
(Howard:)I don't want coffee.

21
00:00:39,879 --> 00:00:41,149
(Raj:)That's why I got you
hot chocolate.

22
00:00:41,313 --> 00:00:43,293
(Howard:)Give me that.

23
00:00:43,449 --> 00:00:45,989
(Howard:)Just stop showing me up.

24
00:00:46,151 --> 00:00:47,491
(Raj:)Howard, listen to me.

25
00:00:47,653 --> 00:00:48,923
(Raj:)You're a great husband.

26
00:00:49,088 --> 00:00:51,498
(Raj:)Yes, your listening skills
could use some work.

27
00:00:51,657 --> 00:00:54,137
(Raj:)But it's amazing
how far you've come

28
00:00:54,259 --> 00:00:59,019
(Raj:)given that you're an only child
raised by an over-protective mom.

